error[SC0411]: `*ib` may be read before anything was assigned to it
    ╭─[ a_local_left_unwritten_on_one_path_does_not_carry_the_other_paths_belief_through_a_copy.c:11:10 ]
    │
  9 │     memcpy(m, &t, 8);
    │     ────────┬───────  
    │             ╰───────── the bytes were copied here
